#: ../../en/extend/index.md:26 ../../en/extend/index.md:35
msgid "Add a scalar Observable"
msgstr "添加标量 Observable"

#: ../../en/extend/index.md:7
msgid "Extend"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../en/extend/index.md:10
msgid "Extend Comfy Research"
msgstr "扩展 Comfy Research"

#: ../../en/extend/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Add a Node through the in-repository definition pipeline, then regenerate "
"and verify the shared backend and frontend contract."
msgstr "通过仓库内定义流水线添加 Node，然后重新生成并验证共享的后端与前端契约。"

#: ../../en/extend/index.md:17
msgid ""
"The extension surface is an in-repository API, not a runtime plugin loader. "
"Definitions, runtime providers, generated metadata, and frontend behavior "
"are reviewed together so saved graphs and executable Nodes do not drift "
"apart."
msgstr ""
"扩展接口是仓库内 API，而非运行时插件加载器。定义、运行时 provider、生成的元数据和前端行为会一并审查，确保已保存图与可执行 Nodes "
"不会漂移。"

#: ../../en/extend/index.md:30
msgid ""
"Follow one complete tutorial from definition and recorder to generated "
"metadata, tests, and application verification."
msgstr "跟随一份完整教程，从定义和 recorder 到生成的元数据、测试和应用验证。"
